    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d651">

                <pb facs="0642" n="568" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg568"/>

                <head>Mr. Hunter to Mr.
                        Tassara</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-06"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 6, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The undersigned, Acting Secretary of State of the United States, has the to
                    inform him, in reply, that copies of the resolutions of sympathy which
                    accompanied it, adopted at a meeting of the Spanish residents of New York, will
                    pursuant to the request of Mr. Tassara, be transmitted to the family of the late
                    President and to the Secretary of State. </p>
                <p>The undersigned offers to Mr. Tassara renewed assurances of his very high
                    consideration. </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W.HUNTER</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Señor Don <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gabriel Garcia y Tassara</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., Washington.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
